[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "師匠……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Saskia...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おめでとう、レスナ。\nあなたは、ついに果ての大陸にたどり着いた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Congratulations, Resna. You finally made it to World's End."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術の復興も進んで……\n師匠として、とても誇らしいわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And alchemy is well on its way to being revived... I couldn't be prouder."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "師匠……今まで、どこにいたんですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Saskia... where have you been all this time?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アトリエに手紙を置いて、私たちをここに呼んだのは\nどうしてですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why did you leave a letter at the atelier and call us out here?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も、聞きたいことがたくさんあるのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I have plenty of questions of my own."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたもアウグストも初めから\n果ての大陸がどこにあるか知ってたんじゃないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You and August knew where World's End was from the very beginning, didn't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなのに、レスナに伝えなかったのはどうして？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So why didn't you just tell Resna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここに繋がる門を守っていた「案内人」ってやつも、\nパルメ族が用意したものっすよね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that 'Guide' guarding the gate here—that was something the Palme put in place, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ザスキアさんも師匠も、いったい何が目的なんすか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...What exactly are you and August after?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "せっかくの再会なのに余韻に浸らせてもくれないのね。\n今まで姿を消していたのは「観測」のためよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not even a moment to savor our reunion, hmm? Very well. I disappeared to observe—that's all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁ、色々と聞かれるだろうことは分かっていたわ。\n私も話そうと思ってあなたたちを呼んだんだもの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I knew you'd have questions. That's precisely why I called you here—I have things I want to tell you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……分かりました。\nすべて、聞かせてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...All right. Then please, tell us everything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まず、「案内人」だけれど……正解！\nあれは私たちパルメ族が用意したものよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "First, the Guide—you're right. That was something we Palme set up."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしてですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたたち人類のためよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For the sake of humanity."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人類のため……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "For humanity...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。レスナを果ての大陸へ導いたのも、\nすべてはあなたたち人類のためよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Guiding Resna to World's End—all of it was for your sake. For all of humanity."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……少し長くなるけれど、聞いてくれるかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This may take a while. Will you hear me out?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]